# Zustand State

- Use Zustand as the client-side state library.
- Keep server data on the server by default; use Zustand only when client-side sharing or coordination is needed.
- Keep stores small and feature-focused, with typed state and actions.
- Select only the state a component needs to avoid unnecessary rerenders.
- Do not duplicate derived values in the store when they can be computed from source state.
